{
  "book": "words-of-mormon",
  "bookName": "Words of Mormon",
  "chapter": 1,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 316.361,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.811,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I, Mormon,",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 1.991,
      "end": 7.796,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "being about to deliver up the record which I have been making into the hands of my son Moroni,",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 7.976,
      "end": 12.527,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold I have witnessed almost all the destruction of my people, the Nephites.",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 13.207,
      "end": 16.458,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it is many hundred years after the coming of Christ",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 16.638,
      "end": 20.121,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I deliver these records into the hands of my son;",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 20.301,
      "end": 24.991,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it supposeth me that he will witness the entire destruction of my people.",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 25.171,
      "end": 27.725,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But may God grant that he may survive them,",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 27.905,
      "end": 30.599,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he may write somewhat concerning them,",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 30.779,
      "end": 32.59,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and somewhat concerning Christ,",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 32.77,
      "end": 35.278,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that perhaps some day it may profit them.",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 35.958,
      "end": 39.813,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, I speak somewhat concerning that which I have written;",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 39.993,
      "end": 44.033,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for after I had made a abridgment from the plates of Nephi,",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 44.213,
      "end": 49.136,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "down to the reign of this king Benjamin, of whom Amaleki spake,",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 49.316,
      "end": 53.588,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I searched among the records which had been delivered into my hands,",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 53.768,
      "end": 55.347,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I found these plates,",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 55.527,
      "end": 63.422,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which contained this small account of the prophets, from Jacob down to the reign of this king Benjamin,",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 63.602,
      "end": 65.97,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also many of the words of Nephi.",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 66.65,
      "end": 72.873,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the things which are upon these plates pleasing me, because of the prophecies of the coming of Christ;",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 73.053,
      "end": 76.722,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and my fathers knowing that many of them have been fulfilled;",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 76.902,
      "end": 83.822,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and I also know that as many things as have been prophesied concerning us down to this day have been fulfilled,",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 84.002,
      "end": 87.764,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and as many as go beyond this day must surely come to pass\u2014",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 88.444,
      "end": 90.766,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, I chose these things,",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 90.946,
      "end": 93.268,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to finish my record upon them,",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 93.448,
      "end": 97.906,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which remainder of my record I shall take from the plates of Nephi;",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 98.086,
      "end": 101.801,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I cannot write the hundredth part of the things of my people.",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 102.481,
      "end": 104.989,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, I shall take these plates,",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 105.169,
      "end": 108.606,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which contain these prophesyings and revelations,",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 108.786,
      "end": 112.223,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and put them with the remainder of my record,",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 112.403,
      "end": 114.307,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they are choice unto me;",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 114.487,
      "end": 117.134,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I know they will be choice unto my brethren.",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 117.814,
      "end": 120.322,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I do this for a wise purpose;",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 120.502,
      "end": 126.121,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for thus it whispereth me, according to the workings of the Spirit of the Lord which is in me.",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 126.301,
      "end": 128.669,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, I do not know all things;",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 128.849,
      "end": 132.193,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but the Lord knoweth all things which are to come;",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 132.373,
      "end": 134.695,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, he worketh in me",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 134.875,
      "end": 136.825,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to do according to his will.",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 137.505,
      "end": 140.524,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And my prayer to God is concerning my brethren,",
      "verse": "1:8",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 140.704,
      "end": 143.908,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they may once again come to the knowledge of God,",
      "verse": "1:8",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 144.088,
      "end": 146.131,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, the redemption of Christ;",
      "verse": "1:8",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 146.311,
      "end": 149.748,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they may once again be a delightsome people.",
      "verse": "1:8",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 150.428,
      "end": 157.162,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I, Mormon, proceed to finish out my record, which I take from the plates of Nephi;",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 157.342,
      "end": 161.8,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I make it according to the knowledge and the understanding which God has given me.",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 162.48,
      "end": 169.353,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, it came to pass that after Amaleki had delivered up these plates into the hands of king Benjamin,",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 169.533,
      "end": 172.366,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he took them and put them with the other plates,",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 172.546,
      "end": 180.301,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which contained records which had been handed down by the kings, from generation to generation until the days of king Benjamin.",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 180.981,
      "end": 186.136,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they were handed down from king Benjamin, from generation to generation",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 186.316,
      "end": 188.777,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "until they have fallen into my hands.",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 188.957,
      "end": 190.954,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I, Mormon, pray to God",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 191.134,
      "end": 194.431,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they may be preserved from this time henceforth.",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 194.611,
      "end": 196.794,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I know that they will be preserved;",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 196.974,
      "end": 199.76,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for there are great things written upon them,",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 199.94,
      "end": 206.07,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "out of which my people and their brethren shall be judged at the great and last day, according to the word of God",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 206.25,
      "end": 207.597,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which is written.",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 208.277,
      "end": 210.971,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, concerning this king Benjamin\u2014",
      "verse": "1:12",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 211.151,
      "end": 214.216,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he had somewhat of contentions among his own people.",
      "verse": "1:12",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 214.896,
      "end": 220.887,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass also that the armies of the Lamanites came down out of the land of Nephi,",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 221.067,
      "end": 222.971,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to battle against his people.",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 223.151,
      "end": 226.913,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, king Benjamin gathered together his armies,",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 227.093,
      "end": 228.997,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he did stand against them;",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 229.177,
      "end": 233.728,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he did fight with the strength of his own arm, with the sword of Laban.",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 234.408,
      "end": 238.82,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And in the strength of the Lord they did contend against their enemies,",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 239.0,
      "end": 242.437,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "until they had slain many thousands of the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 242.617,
      "end": 246.564,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they did contend against the Lamanites",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 246.744,
      "end": 250.645,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "until they had driven them out of all the lands of their inheritance.",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 251.325,
      "end": 255.365,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that after there had been false Christs,",
      "verse": "1:15",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 255.545,
      "end": 257.635,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their mouths had been shut,",
      "verse": "1:15",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 257.815,
      "end": 260.044,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they punished according to their crimes;",
      "verse": "1:15",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 260.724,
      "end": 262.907,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after there had been false prophets,",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 263.087,
      "end": 266.338,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and false preachers and teachers among the people,",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 266.518,
      "end": 269.676,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all these having been punished according to their crimes;",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 269.856,
      "end": 272.875,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and after there having been much contention",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 273.055,
      "end": 276.259,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and many dissensions away unto the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 276.439,
      "end": 279.365,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, it came to pass that king Benjamin,",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 279.545,
      "end": 283.539,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "with the assistance of the holy prophets who were among his people\u2014",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 284.219,
      "end": 286.913,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, king Benjamin was a holy man,",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 287.093,
      "end": 290.019,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he did reign over his people in righteousness;",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 290.199,
      "end": 292.8,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there were many holy men in the land,",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 292.98,
      "end": 297.392,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did speak the word of God with power and with authority;",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 297.572,
      "end": 302.123,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did use much sharpness because of the stiffneckedness of the people\u2014",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 302.803,
      "end": 304.939,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, with the help of these,",
      "verse": "1:18",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 305.119,
      "end": 308.881,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "king Benjamin, by laboring with all the might of his body",
      "verse": "1:18",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 309.061,
      "end": 311.197,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the faculty of his whole soul,",
      "verse": "1:18",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 311.377,
      "end": 315.696,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also the prophets, did once more establish peace in the land.",
      "verse": "1:18",
      "lineIndex": 88
    }
  ]
}